WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.535
Prefer to talk? Voice runs entirely on your own machine. Hold Control, Shift, V, anywhere. Say what you want, and let go.

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:09.702
“Open two Codex agents.”

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:16.192
“Arrange the screen.”

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.769
To talk to one agent, just start with its name.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.969
“Nova, make the toggle follow the system theme.”
